- **v2 (2026-06-19):** **Deep-audit correction.** 4 audit agents + direct source found the v1 RunContext-via-ContextVar design breaks current logic in 3 confirmed ways (AF1 dispatch getters/tests/base-loop read post-call; AF2 `_workspace` has construction+post-call lifetime; AF3 role dispatch requires the instance, not an index). **Initiative B rewritten** from "ContextVar + immutable definition + index roles" to a **non-breaking instance-held `RunState` consolidation behind compat properties**; `_workspace`, `session`, and role-instances explicitly **left untouched**; ContextVar/immutability/index-roles **deferred** (§E2-defer). Added §2.0 audit table; corrected §2.1–§2.4, §E2, §D5, §A3. Regression gate = the existing `test_multi_flow_*` / `test_mfdual_*` suites must pass unchanged.
